        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand over the land of Egypt for the locusts, that they may come upon the land of Egypt, and eat every plant in the land, all that the hail has left.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses stretched forth his rod over the land of Egypt, and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " brought an east wind upon the land all that day and all that night; and when it was morning the east wind had brought the locusts. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the locusts came up over all the land of Egypt, and settled on the whole country of Egypt, such a dense swarm of locusts as had never been before, nor ever shall be again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For they covered the face of the whole land, so that the land was darkened, and they ate all the plants in the land and all the fruit of the trees which the hail had left; not a green thing remained, neither tree nor plant of the field, through all the land of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Pharaoh called Moses and Aaron in haste, and said, “I have sinned against the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, and against you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now therefore, forgive my sin, I pray you, only this once, and entreat the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God only to remove this death from me.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he went out from Pharaoh, and entreated the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " turned a very strong west wind, which lifted the locusts and drove them into the Red Sea; not a single locust was left in all the country of Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hardened Pharaoh's heart, and he did not let the children of Israel go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
