        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Stretch out your hand toward heaven that there may be darkness over the land of Egypt, a darkness to be felt.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses stretched out his hand toward heaven, and there was thick darkness in all the land of Egypt three days; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they did not see one another, nor did any rise from his place for three days; but all the people of Israel had light where they dwelt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Pharaoh called Moses, and said, “Go, serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; your children also may go with you; only let your flocks and your herds remain behind.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Moses said, “You must also let us have sacrifices and burnt offerings, that we may sacrifice to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 10:26"
          },
